Build the image. `genimage` installs the base OS and the OpenHPC components
together and builds the netboot initrd:

<!-- ohpc_begin -->
<!-- ohpc_comment Build the compute image (base OS + OpenHPC in one pass) -->
```bash
genimage ${xcat_osimage}
```
<!-- ohpc_end -->
